    "detailed_description": "Fight you way with up to three friends, battling hordes of enemies, customizing your ship with devastating combos. Uncover secrets in this innovative class-based horizontal shooter multiplayer game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/91a14a353e5d110417e42248e4e244ba.avif?t=1722739064\" width=600 height=242 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with over 10 ships, each with 3 distinct skills, showcasing clear strengths and weaknesses.<br></li><li>Play as a tank, support or dps and build with your friends the perfect team.<br></li><li>Select 3 upgrades from a pool of 10 each playthrough, creating numerous powerful combinations.<br></li><li>Team up with friends locally for an exhilarating multiplayer experience.<br></li><li>Forge a unique path on a procedurally generated map teeming with hidden secrets.<br></li><li>Confront diverse challenges across meticulously crafted stages. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class: TANK</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/d2178c2661c8ea256021f6dce4a2be4c.avif?t=1722739064\" width=700 height=450 /></span><br><br>Protect your friends either by taking direct hits for them or by strategically disrupting the enemy lines<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/e42ef4b54f2c4b3146d61a1f81b4706d.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/e42ef4b54f2c4b3146d61a1f81b4706d.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/e42ef4b54f2c4b3146d61a1f81b4706d.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class: SUPPORT</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/1fd40a41cb6124eb8400d7255bdca418.avif?t=1722739064\" width=700 height=450 /></span><br><br>Support your friends by either restoring their health or enhancing their combat skills<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/282d25b5471cf4e5a13746c0cb41b6d2.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/282d25b5471cf4e5a13746c0cb41b6d2.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/282d25b5471cf4e5a13746c0cb41b6d2.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class: DPS</h2><br>Battle through obstacles with either sustained damage, area-of-effect attacks, or rapid bursts to clear your path effectively<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/00e031419fc392de4934b02b986eb5a8.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/00e031419fc392de4934b02b986eb5a8.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/00e031419fc392de4934b02b986eb5a8.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/0c922a764c36723925be55e50b099d07.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/0c922a764c36723925be55e50b099d07.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/0c922a764c36723925be55e50b099d07.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Fight you way with up to three friends, battling hordes of enemies, customizing your ship with devastating combos. Uncover secrets in this innovative class-based horizontal shooter multiplayer game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/91a14a353e5d110417e42248e4e244ba.avif?t=1722739064\" width=600 height=242 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with over 10 ships, each with 3 distinct skills, showcasing clear strengths and weaknesses.<br></li><li>Play as a tank, support or dps and build with your friends the perfect team.<br></li><li>Select 3 upgrades from a pool of 10 each playthrough, creating numerous powerful combinations.<br></li><li>Team up with friends locally for an exhilarating multiplayer experience.<br></li><li>Forge a unique path on a procedurally generated map teeming with hidden secrets.<br></li><li>Confront diverse challenges across meticulously crafted stages. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class: TANK</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/d2178c2661c8ea256021f6dce4a2be4c.avif?t=1722739064\" width=700 height=450 /></span><br><br>Protect your friends either by taking direct hits for them or by strategically disrupting the enemy lines<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/e42ef4b54f2c4b3146d61a1f81b4706d.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/e42ef4b54f2c4b3146d61a1f81b4706d.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/e42ef4b54f2c4b3146d61a1f81b4706d.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class: SUPPORT</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/1fd40a41cb6124eb8400d7255bdca418.avif?t=1722739064\" width=700 height=450 /></span><br><br>Support your friends by either restoring their health or enhancing their combat skills<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/282d25b5471cf4e5a13746c0cb41b6d2.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/282d25b5471cf4e5a13746c0cb41b6d2.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/282d25b5471cf4e5a13746c0cb41b6d2.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class: DPS</h2><br>Battle through obstacles with either sustained damage, area-of-effect attacks, or rapid bursts to clear your path effectively<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/00e031419fc392de4934b02b986eb5a8.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/00e031419fc392de4934b02b986eb5a8.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/00e031419fc392de4934b02b986eb5a8.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/0c922a764c36723925be55e50b099d07.poster.avif?t=1722739064\" width=672 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/0c922a764c36723925be55e50b099d07.webm?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641360/extras/0c922a764c36723925be55e50b099d07.mp4?t=1722739064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
